  let c ∈ ℝ                                                           (H4)
  let d ∈ ℝ                                                           (H5)
  assume d > 0                                                        (H6)
  then a·b < c·d ↔ a/d < c/b

1.  a·b < c·d ↔ a/d < c/b
    mun:numbers-cross-multiplied-order, from H3, H6

